-//	stage → durable CF mint at stage-mint.fullsend.sh
+//	dev      → CF preview mint (ephemeral per run)
+//	stage    → durable CF mint at stage-mint.fullsend.sh
+//	external → a mint already running at FULLSEND_MINT_URL, on the forge
